      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly it’s just quiet. so quiet. used to have my whole life planned out, training schedules, competitions, everything. now i just wake up and i’m just... here. the injury took the only thing that made me feel real. it feels like the best part of my story is already written and finished, and now i'm just dragging out the boring parts.",
